WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:04.637
Ta-da!

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.841
Hello, nice to meet you!

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:10.744
I am Netflix's official VTuber,

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.212
N-ko.

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:14.381
My full name is

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:16.883
N-ko Mei Kurono.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:20.387
I'm a sheep-human lifeform born in California.

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:24.424
I am Netflix Anime Club's manager, and I love anime.

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:26.393
My mission concerns

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.995
shows streaming on Netflix:

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:30.964
the fun anime and movies,

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:34.534
to let many more people know about them.

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:36.670
To accomplish my mission,

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:38.138
I, N-ko,

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:42.409
am played by one of Netflix's employees.

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:44.377
I am played by an employee,

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:46.880
who knows the contents very well.

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:49.816
That's why I can tell you the charm of our anime

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:51.751
very thoroughly.

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:56.623
I cannot tell you much about the details of the work I usually do,

00:00:56.690 --> 00:00:59.592
but I have meetings with offices around the world,

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:02.429
and make various adjustments at work

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:05.298
to make the anime even more appealing.

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:08.735
I'll tell you a little bit more about myself.

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:14.341
I love singing, dancing and getting a massage,

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:17.544
but I don't like writing kanji,

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:20.747
and anything that contains elements of horror.

00:01:20.814 --> 00:01:25.352
On my days off, I often hang out with my friends.

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:27.854
Regarding anime I like,

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:30.557
I can't finish talking about them in this video,

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:33.226
so I'll do that later as the project proceeds.

00:01:33.293 --> 00:01:34.961
Oh, also,

00:01:35.028 --> 00:01:37.697
I was born and raised in America,

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:40.800
so I can speak in both Japanese and English.

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:43.903
I'll introduce myself briefly in English too.

00:01:44.471 --> 00:01:48.141
Hi, my name is N-ko Mei Kurono.

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:50.110
I'm a sheep-human lifeform,

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:51.811
born in California.

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:55.315
I'm Netflix Anime's new brand ambassador

00:01:55.382 --> 00:01:58.251
who, of course, loves anime.

00:01:58.318 --> 00:02:04.257
Basically, from among the various shows streamed on Netflix,

00:02:04.324 --> 00:02:07.193
I'll introduce anime I recommend

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:09.429
in the videos I upload,

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:12.832
which hopefully will make you interested in them.

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:17.103
Also, I will do collabs with my VTuber seniors,

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:22.242
and I'd like to try covering songs and do game commentaries too.

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:27.714
Also, I would like to be friends with my viewers watching this now,

00:02:27.781 --> 00:02:29.683
so please use hashtags on Twitter,

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:31.484
or leave me comments on YouTube.

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:34.220
I'm waiting for many messages from you.

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:39.626
Please ask me questions on Twitter
or in my YouTube videos' comment section.

00:02:39.693 --> 00:02:43.997
To spark your interest in Netflix itself as a company,

00:02:44.064 --> 00:02:48.234
I'll be telling you information that only employees know,

00:02:48.301 --> 00:02:50.170
so please look forward to it.

00:02:50.704 --> 00:02:53.506
Well, my greetings to you, again.

00:02:53.573 --> 00:02:56.676
I look forward to seeing you in the future.

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:59.145
See you!

